			"Message": "style(Vine): Normalize punctuation and table formatting in README\n\nReplace em-dashes with hyphens throughout the README for consistency with the rest of the crate's documentation style. Re-wrap the Related Documentation section links to align with the project's hard-wrap conventions and fix table column alignment in the feature and component reference tables.\n\nNo behavioral changes — documentation formatting only.",
